#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "      When you submit this form, we collect your name, email address, and "
#| "message\n"
#| "      for the sole purpose of responding to your inquiry. Technical "
#| "metadata\n"
#| "      (such as IP address in hashed form and browser information) may "
#| "also be\n"
#| "      processed to ensure security and prevent abuse. Your data will not "
#| "be used\n"
#| "      for marketing without your explicit consent. Submissions are stored "
#| "securely\n"
#| "      and deleted once they are no longer needed. You have the right to "
#| "request\n"
#| "      access, correction, or deletion of your data at any time.\n"
#| "      "
msgid ""
"\n"
"        When you submit this form, we collect your name, email address, and "
"message\n"
"        for the sole purpose of responding to your inquiry. Technical "
"metadata\n"
"        (such as IP address in hashed form and browser information) may also "
"be\n"
"        processed to ensure security and prevent abuse. Your data will not "
"be used\n"
"        for marketing without your explicit consent. Submissions are stored "
"securely\n"
"        and deleted once they are no longer needed. You have the right to "
"request\n"
"        access, correction, or deletion of your data at any time.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      Wenn Sie dieses Formular absenden, erfassen wir Ihren Namen, Ihre E-"
"Mail-Adresse und Ihre Nachricht ausschließlich, um Ihre Anfrage zu "
"beantworten. Technische Metadaten (z. B. eine gehashte IP-Adresse und "
"Browserinformationen) können ebenfalls verarbeitet werden, um die Sicherheit "
"zu gewährleisten und Missbrauch zu verhindern. Ihre Daten werden ohne Ihre "
"ausdrückliche Einwilligung nicht zu Marketingzwecken verwendet. Die "
"Einsendungen werden sicher gespeichert und gelöscht, sobald sie nicht mehr "
"benötigt werden. Sie haben jederzeit das Recht, Auskunft, Berichtigung oder "
"Löschung Ihrer Daten zu verlangen.\n"
"      "

